{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03141","headline":"同綦毋学士月夜闻雁 · 张九龄","name":"同綦毋学士月夜闻雁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栖宿岂无意，飞飞更远寻。\n长途未及半，中夜有遗音。\n月思关山笛，风号流水琴。\n空声两相应，幽感一何深。\n避缴归南浦，离羣呌北林。\n联翩俱不定，怜尔越乡心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03141.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03141","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}